, 12 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"writing-wall-2017-04-12-e6","era":null,"summary":"Hapatra reveals the God-Pharaoh's return and the Hours begin when the sun rests between the horns, any day now.","participants":["hapatra","nissa-revane","chandra-nalaar","nicol-bolas"],"location":"rhonas-s-monument","importance":"major","page":"stories/writing-wall-2017-04-12","order":601,"story_date":"2017-04-12","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":152,"quote":"\"The Hours will begin when the sun rests between the horns. I'd estimate any day now.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/writing-wall-2017-04-12#:~:text=%22The%20Hours%20will%20begin,estimate%20any%20day%20now.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Writing on the Wall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-04-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/writing-wall-2017-04-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/writing-wall-2017-04-12#:~:text=%22The%20Hours%20will%20begin,estimate%20any%20day%20now.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Writing on the Wall\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"writing-wall-2017-04-12-e7","era":null,"summary":"Nissa and Chandra realize they have two days to find answers and follow Nissa's sense of the woman's energy toward an alley.","participants":["nissa-revane","chandra-nalaar"],"location":"rhonas-s-monument","importance":"minor","page":"stories/writing-wall-2017-04-12","order":601,"story_date":"2017-04-12","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":173,"quote":"felt the tug of the woman's energy through what was left of the leylines.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/writing-wall-2017-04-12#:~:text=felt%20the%20tug%20of,left%20of%20the%20leylines.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Writing on the Wall",